# INVWINI.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the item list
# after a login, by ID, and its moves, TAB and F6 doing nothing without
# the split view; Next order (Record menu) through the orders and every
# browse entry of the Items menu; ENTER on an item, which shows it in
# view mode; the frame maximized and restored; log-out and login with
# the list open, and the end by File > Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINI.SNP is its snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
S LIST
K DOWN
S DOWN
K END
S END
K HOME
S HOME
K PGDN
S PGDN
K PGUP
S PGUP
# without the split view TAB, F6 and their SHIFT forms do nothing
K TAB F6 SHIFT-TAB SHIFT-F6
S NOPANE
# UP on the first row stays; Next order goes on to the next order,
# wrapping
K UP ALT-C R
S TABLOC
K ALT-C R ALT-C R
S TABSER
K ALT-C R
S TABID
# the browse entries open the list again in their order
K ALT-I M
S BYMFR
K ALT-I S
S BYSER
K ALT-I L
S BYLOC
K ALT-I I
S BYID
# ENTER on an item: its form, after whose OK the list is as it was
K DOWN ENTER
S ENTER
K ENTER
S ENTERED
# maximized and restored, the list keeps its order, its first row
# selected (whether a size opens it again, which a list shorter than
# every window cannot show, depends on the screen)
K ALT-I S ALT-SPACE X
S MAX
K ALT-SPACE R
S RESTORE
# log out with the list open, then in again: the list by ID
K ALT-I M ALT-F L
S LOGOUT
T Retro1986
K ENTER
S AGAIN
K ALT-F X
S GONE
